id: flash-input-hold
section: Flash
item: With the gesture lock on, a hold keeps the button down for its whole length and a drag sends moves along its path
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
wait text ready stage= 30
dtap 240 272
expect keyboard up
pause 2500
hold 240 272 2000
wait text up up 5
expect number heldms 1500 3200
expect number n-down 1 1
expect number n-up 1 1
drag 100 200 400 400 1000
wait text up up 5
expect flash-el move 360 277 30
expect press-rate 20
